// Quantifier examples
// Using quantifiers with the solve command

#symbols(a, b)

// Universal quantifier: for all x, P(x) holds
@forall x: P(x)

// Existential quantifier: there exists x such that P(x) holds
@exists x: P(x)

// Universal with implication (note the parentheses!)
@forall x: (P(x) -> Q(x))

// Existential with conjunction (note the parentheses!)
@exists x: (P(x) & Q(x))
